# Challenge 2 (speed, 45 s) left to run out: the round ends with "Time ran out".
# viewport 1280x800@1
# Generated by tools/gen-plays.mjs from the rules' solver.
until 600 Daily challenge
frames 20
click =Play
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
click =Challenge
until 120 Challenge 2
frames 10
click =Challenge 2 — speed
until 300 Left 0:45
frames 10
until 3000 Time ran out
frames 10
save challenge-over
expect Retry to keep your streak alive
